\fs48 \cf2 Run and Debug view\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The Run and Debug view includes a button to launch debug sessions and a menu to select debug configurations. It also has areas to display current variables, watch expressions, the current call stack, and breakpoints.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
